# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites.
# Copied to web/build/_redirects by scripts/build-pages.sh.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# The artifact is built for GitHub Pages under the base path
# /RivicQ_CSPM_EaaS/. On Cloudflare Pages it is served from the site root, so the
# first rule strips that base path (200 = internal rewrite, not a browser
# redirect). Sub-app assets then resolve normally (/static/*, /fabric/*,
# /docs/*, /marketing/*, /media/*, /api/*, /archify/*); unmatched paths fall
# through to the SPA shell.

# 1) Strip the GitHub Pages base path for every request.
/RivicQ_CSPM_EaaS/*  /:splat  200

# 2) SPA fallback for the React app client routes.
/*  /index.html  200
